WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.710
From drought to flooding, extreme weather and climate change

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.540
is being felt around the world.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.950
Global temperatures are rising.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.920
But why does that matter?

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.330
What do rising temperatures mean for us,

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:15.190
and will fixing the problem cost you money?
